这不像你在第八季中会说，是的，我知道巴尼的事是什么。

00:10:18.889 --> 00:10:24.350
There wasn't that much Barney, but you had to come in and be like, revealed that you had taught Barney so much.
巴尼没有那么多，但你必须进来并表现出你教了巴尼很多东西。

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:25.669
You were his big brother.
你是他的大哥。

00:10:25.669 --> 00:10:33.629
You had to sort of out Barney Barney, but in your own completely different way, what did that feel like coming in and having to hit all of those notes?
你必须把巴尼·巴尼（Barney Barney）整理出来，但以你自己完全不同的方式，进来并必须击中所有这些音符是什么感觉？

00:10:33.629 --> 00:10:47.190
It was one of those things that, because luckily, like I said, I'd watch the show, but rarely do you get the opportunity that someone says, come in and do something very specific to what the other actor's doing.
这是其中之一，因为幸运的是，就像我说的，我会看这部剧，但你很少有机会像有人说的那样，进来做一些与其他演员正在做的事情非常具体的事情。

00:10:47.190 --> 00:11:04.389
So in a way, the pressure was off because I knew what the legend dairy thing was, but also now I have to also be my, that I've got to make James his own guy so that you guys know what he is.
所以在某种程度上，压力消失了，因为我知道传奇乳制品是什么，但现在我也必须成为我自己的人，我必须让詹姆斯成为他自己的人，这样你们就知道他是什么。

00:11:04.389 --> 00:11:06.389
So that was cool.
所以这很酷。

00:11:06.389 --> 00:11:14.389
And I think, I definitely think, I mean, like not to blow smoke, but like you guys, the writing, it was there.
我想，我绝对认为，我的意思是，不要抽烟，但就像你们一样，写作，它就在那里。

00:11:14.389 --> 00:11:18.470
And then you just were able to take it and go to the other place with it.
然后你就可以拿着它去另一个地方了。

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:23.190
And then working with Neil was so great because I already knew Neil and we'd worked together.
与尼尔一起工作真是太棒了，因为我已经认识尼尔了，而且我们一起工作过。

