I would think that was the most rock and roll thing that ever seen how I fall in like towel in Vegas because I'll say I don't want to go to a club guys.
我认为这是我在拉斯维加斯像毛巾一样摔倒的最摇滚的事情，因为我会说我不想去俱乐部。

